PARITY MAP (disclosed Apple-idiomatic adaptations — web is THE spec)
  • Web PWA "Add to home screen" -> native Home/Lock-Screen widget (iOS) / pin (macOS) affordance.
  • Web beforeinstallprompt capture -> InstallabilityProbe.canInstall(); isStandaloneMode() ->
    isInstalled(); wasDismissedRecently() (14-day localStorage) -> UserDefaults dismissal + window.
  • Web handleInstall (deferredPrompt.prompt + userChoice) -> embedder onInstall() returning accepted,
    then markInstalled -> hides. Web handleDismiss (persist + broadcast) -> persist + NotificationCenter
    cross-scene post. Web cross-tab subscribe -> NotificationCenter subscription (ignores own post).
  • P4 leaf additions (same as sibling banners): the empty kinds render calm honest cards instead of
    the web blank null, plus the orthogonal stale/offline freshness chip + one-shot auto-refresh.

